{
  "file": "module3",
  "page": 165,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        110.85870361328125,
        348.8629150390625,
        149.09869384765625
      ],
      "text": "Annex 1. Guideline",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bk",
      "size": 32.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        149.25872802734375,
        396.4244689941406,
        187.49871826171875
      ],
      "text": "development methods",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bk",
      "size": 32.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        226.0064239501953,
        488.4845275878906,
        242.3864288330078
      ],
      "text": "Methods used to develop World Health Organization guidelines",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        252.6373291015625,
        527.0140380859375,
        265.7823486328125
      ],
      "text": "To develop new or update existing guidelines for methods and tools to diagnose tuberculosis",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        268.1373291015625,
        527.0187377929688,
        281.2823486328125
      ],
      "text": "(TB), the World Health Organization (WHO) Global TB Programme commissions systematic",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        283.6373291015625,
        527.0350341796875,
        296.7823486328125
      ],
      "text": "reviews on the performance or use of the tool or method in question. A systematic review",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        299.1373291015625,
        527.0030517578125,
        312.2823486328125
      ],
      "text": "provides a summary of the current literature on diagnostic accuracy or user aspects, for the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        314.6373291015625,
        527.0029907226562,
        327.7823486328125
      ],
      "text": "diagnosis of TB or the detection of anti-TB drug resistance in adults or children (or both) with",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        330.1372985839844,
        200.13681030273438,
        343.2823181152344
      ],
      "text": "signs and symptoms of TB.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        354.14129638671875,
        526.8053588867188,
        367.28631591796875
      ],
      "text": "The certainty of the evidence is assessed consistently for documented evidence using the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        369.64129638671875,
        526.9810180664062,
        382.78631591796875
      ],
      "text": "Grading of Recommendations Assessment, Development and Evaluation (GRADE) approach.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        385.14129638671875,
        526.991943359375,
        398.28631591796875
      ],
      "text": "GRADE produces an overall quality assessment (or certainty) of evidence and a framework",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        400.64129638671875,
        526.8272094726562,
        413.78631591796875
      ],
      "text": "for translating evidence into recommendations. The certainty of the evidence is rated as",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        416.14129638671875,
        526.9633178710938,
        429.28631591796875
      ],
      "text": "high, moderate, low or very low. These four categories imply a gradient of confidence in the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        431.64129638671875,
        526.966796875,
        444.78631591796875
      ],
      "text": "estimates. Even if a diagnostic accuracy study is of observational design, it would initially be",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        447.14129638671875,
        369.5661926269531,
        460.28631591796875
      ],
      "text": "considered high-quality evidence in the GRADE approach  . (1)",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        471.14520263671875,
        527.276611328125,
        484.29022216796875
      ],
      "text": "In addition, the WHO Global TB Programme commissions systematic reviews to collect evidence",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.958069801330566,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        486.64520263671875,
        526.9656372070312,
        499.79022216796875
      ],
      "text": "in the field of resource use (i.e. cost and cost–effectiveness), as well as end-user perspectives",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        502.14520263671875,
        526.93701171875,
        515.2902221679688
      ],
      "text": "on particular diagnostic tests or interventions. This evidence-to-recommendation process will",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        517.6452026367188,
        437.6554870605469,
        530.7902221679688
      ],
      "text": "inform domains such as feasibility, accessibility, equity and end-user values.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        541.6491088867188,
        527.0093994140625,
        554.7941284179688
      ],
      "text": "If systematic review evidence is unavailable or is scarce, the potential subsequent effects can be",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.972616195678711,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        557.1491088867188,
        526.9656982421875,
        570.2941284179688
      ],
      "text": "modelled for both diagnostic accuracy as well as cost and cost–effectiveness. For instance, the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        572.6491088867188,
        526.9700927734375,
        585.7941284179688
      ],
      "text": "prevalence of the disease in question, combined with the sensitivity and specificity of a certain",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.996099472045898,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        588.1491088867188,
        527.1935424804688,
        601.2941284179688
      ],
      "text": "test, can be used to estimate the number of false positives and false negatives in a population.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.99804973602295,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        603.6491088867188,
        526.969970703125,
        616.7941284179688
      ],
      "text": "Similarly, data on expenditures and cost–effectiveness ratios can be estimated and modelled,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        619.1491088867188,
        526.936767578125,
        632.2941284179688
      ],
      "text": "based on economical and epidemiological data. Finally, qualitative evidence on the end-user",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        634.6491088867188,
        527.0029296875,
        647.7941284179688
      ],
      "text": "perspective of using a particular test may be generated through end-user interviews if data",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        650.1491088867188,
        225.73287963867188,
        663.2941284179688
      ],
      "text": "are scarce in the public domain.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        674.153076171875,
        526.8932495117188,
        687.298095703125
      ],
      "text": "Following a systematic review, the WHO Global TB Programme convenes a Guideline",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        689.653076171875,
        526.991943359375,
        702.798095703125
      ],
      "text": "Development Group (GDG) meeting to review the collected evidence. The GDG is made up of",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        705.153076171875,
        527.2506713867188,
        718.298095703125
      ],
      "text": "external experts whose central task is to develop evidence-based recommendations. The GDG",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.997550010681152,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        720.653076171875,
        526.9633178710938,
        733.798095703125
      ],
      "text": "also performs the important task of finalizing the scope and key questions of the guideline in",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        736.153076171875,
        415.2485656738281,
        749.298095703125
      ],
      "text": "PICO (i.e. population, intervention, comparator and outcomes) format.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        543.0333862304688,
        802.0169067382812,
        556.809326171875,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "149",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}